<title>USA: Gaston Cty, N.C., won by Wachovia Bank.</title>
<headline>Gaston Cty, N.C., won by Wachovia Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Bank said it won $31.350 million of Gaston Cty, N.C., public improvement bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.492 percent.</p>
</text>
